Ethan: SAY IT!

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:06.620
Tyler: *sigh*

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:07.780
Tyler: *excitedly* Gobble, gobble...

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:10.520
*Mark hyperventilates*

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:22.260
*Some epic Christmas music*

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:25.340
*And then there's weird Mark*

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:32.080
(wheeee let's make this Christmas LIT)

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:35.800
(I spy with my little eye a random snowman guy)

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:43.960
Mark: *quietly* Ok,so...

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:45.900
I have an idea, um...

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:50.520
It's November and everyone is already celebrating Christmas,

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:53.360
So i'v got a special outfit.. For Tyler to have... (poor Tyler)

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.040
and uh...

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:00.720
Mark: *barges in XD*

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:01.280
Tyler: WOAH! WOAH!

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:01.940
Mark: Hey! *laughs*

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.020
Mark: I didn't know the toilet was that close to the door! (thank god it's blurry)

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:05.960
Mark: *excitedly* I've got an idea!

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:07.060
Tyler: What!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.480
Tyler: Well couldn't it get wait?! (grammar on point, Tyler)

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:10.020
Mark: No!...um...

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:11.560
Can we uh...

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:13.240
can we have you wear this...thing?

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:14.120
Tyler: WHA-WHAT IS IT?!

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:15.200
Mark: it's a.. costume.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.440
Tyler: *confused stuttering*

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:16.940
Mark: Sorry to interrupt! *laughs*

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:18.360
Tyler:I don't wanna- *Mark shuts door*

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.240
Tyler: I DON'T WANNA WEAR THIS!

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:22.500
Tyler: What the hell am I doing in this FRICKIN' costume?!

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:24.260
Mark: You can't talk, you're a turkey.

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:25.840
Say it... *smiles and gives a little giggle*

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.020
Ethan: Say it..

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:28.860
Mark: Say the thing.

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:30.600
Tyler: *clearly annoyed* GOBBLE GOBBLE.

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.080
Mark: Okay, somebody ask me what we're doing...

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:32.720
Tyler: *annoyed again* I JUST DID.

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:33.580
Mark: Ask again...please.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:36.500
Tyler: What the hell am I doing in this costume?

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:37.000
Mark: We're gonna-

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.120
Ethan: That's not your real voice..

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:40.900
Mark; ya- YA, *in between giggling* THAT'S NOT YOUR REAL VOICE!

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:42.920
Mark: Talk in your real voice!

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:44.120
Tyler: *normally* What the hell am I doing in this costume?

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.700
Mark and Ethan: NO, NO, NO! THAT'S NOT YOUR REAL ONE!

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:48.340
Tyler: WHAT ARE YOU TALKING- *realizes what they want*

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:51.420
Ethan: Stop putting on an accent, and just say it in your normal voice! *giggles from Mark*

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:53.440
Why are you so insecure about it? Mark: ya man...

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:54.480
Ethan: Come on!

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.600
You don't have to be afraid, you're around friends... (poor peer pressured Tyler)

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:57.260
Tyler: I hate you both...

00:01:57.260 --> 00:01:58.040
Ethan: It's a safe place here.

00:01:58.040 --> 00:01:58.860
Tyler: I HATE you both.

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:01.200
Ethan and Mark: *encouraging noises*

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:01.700
Tyler: No..

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:04.280
Ethan: Come on... Mark: please.

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:08.480
Tyler: This is what I do for you guys, I'm forced to do this!

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:10.000
Tyler: GOBBLE GOBBLE.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:12.320
Mark: So we're just leaving Target, uh,

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:15.160
we were gonna do a funny vid in there with Tyler in the turkey costume,

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:17.740
uh, going around and shopping for Christmas stuff,

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:19.760
We were gonna have a lot of good footage there,

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:21.560
But then Target security came over and like,

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:23.620
3 different people from them were like,

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:26.560
"You can't film here! Don't do that! You absolutely can not!"

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:27.820
Um... Which is fine,

00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:32.600
It's their right, i'm not gonna criticize their right to refuse us to film there, uh,

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:34.720
But, it's also within OUR RIGHT,

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:36.760
To list all of target's competitors! XD

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:38.680
So, *evil giggle* here they are:

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:41.720
*elevator music*

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:43.500
Mark: *loud gobbles to the starting tune of "Jingle bells" (thought y'all said that Christmas could wait)

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:52.440
*Tyler and Ethan join in*

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.200
*Tyler says gobble wrong*

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:56.700
Mark: No! GO-BBLE!

00:02:56.700 --> 00:03:04.660
*All start singing even louder (RIP headphone users)*

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:05.800
Mark: *starts giggling*

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:06.700
*all giggle*

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:07.400
Mark: GOBB!

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:11.220
Mark: I know we're all angry at Target, but we need to channel our energy, to make the best sketch possible!

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:14.080
Mark: *dramatic turn* WHAT sketch you ask?!

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:15.740
Tyler: Gobble! (gobble gobble gobble)

00:03:15.740 --> 00:03:17.180
Mark: Shut the fuck up.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:19.020
*Warm, Christmas music*

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:19.520
