00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:20.800
*music continues*

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:22.940
(it's so nice)

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:26.780
*Mark sighs softly*

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:36.300
Mark: *winds up music box*

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:44.980
Mark: *softly singing Christmas music*

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:52.420
*Music starts dying away* (uh oh here comes the turkey)

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:55.180
Turkey Tyler: *Banging on door* (he has a weapon protect yourself mark)

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:57.580
Mark: *concerned*  uh...

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:59.420
*dramatic music starts playing*

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:02.080
turkey Tyler: *heavy breathing*

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:06.880
Mark: *screaming* (we warned you mark)

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:09.460
Mark: *struggling noises*

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:15.380
Mark: *gasping* (stand up mark. pls.)

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:17.100
Mark: *valiantly struggles*

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:20.160
Mark: NO! IT'S CHRISTMAS, THEY SAID IT WAS OK! (they all do, don't they)

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:22.080
NO! IT'S AFTER HALLOWEEN!

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:25.080
Mark: *one last struggle*

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:26.740
Turkey Tyler: GOBBLE GOBBLE, BITCH! (the turkey gets his revenge)

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:31.680
