00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:38.200
Turkey Tyler: *gobbles*

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:42.480
*casually sips orange juice while one-leggedly propelling his skateboard*

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:46.880
Mark: Oh yeah, ketchup.

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:47.440
Oh hello!

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:49.560
Mark: You do!

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:51.180
Really?

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:52.320
That's me!

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:53.120
Cool!

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:55.620
Oh, that's awesome! Tyler: Yeah!

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:57.420
Ethan: Did you like it?

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:59.420
Mark: Did you like it? Tyler: Yeah!

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:01.040
