Mark: Really?

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.620
Mark: Aw, happy Thanksgiving! Say the thing, Tyler!

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:08.820
Mark and Ethan: Say it!

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.020
Tyler: *oh so enthusiastically* Gobble, gobble.

